# Cycle through things also offers what can only be taken (the furs in the hut on map 4, next to the bedroll); E on such a thing takes it into the backpack
args: --map 4 --pos 10512,9720,48
do: t5;pickthing:1;pickthing:1;pickthing:1;pickthing:1;usenear;item:36452
expect: pickthing: id 36452 shape  659
expect: pickthing name: Some("bedroll")
expect: pickthing: id 36476 shape  659
expect: usenear: id 36452 shape  659
expect: id 36733 shape  529 frame   0 at 0,0,7
reject: usenear notice:
